---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'June 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Pech Group's privacy policy covering how we collect, use, and protect your personal information, including CCPA compliance for California residents."
>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section__label">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-header__sub">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-content">

      <div class="legal-notice">
        <strong>Notice:</strong> This Privacy Policy has been drafted to reflect our data practices and applicable law.
        It should be reviewed by qualified legal counsel before the website is made publicly available.
      </div>

      <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p>
        Pech Group ("we," "us," or "our") is a boutique executive advisory firm headquartered in the
        San Francisco Bay Area, California, with operations in Texas and Mexico. This Privacy Policy
        describes how we collect, use, and protect information you provide when visiting pechgroup.com
        or contacting us through the website.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information in two ways:</p>
      <h3>Information you provide directly</h3>
      <p>When you submit our contact form or early-access waitlist form, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Full name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Company name (optional)</li>
        <li>Phone number or WhatsApp (optional)</li>
        <li>Your message or inquiry</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
      <p>
        We use privacy-respecting analytics (such as Plausible Analytics or similar) that do not use
        cookies, do not track individuals across sites, and do not collect personally identifiable
        information. Aggregate, anonymized usage data may be collected to help us understand how
        visitors use the site.
      </p>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you submit through our forms solely to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your inquiry or request</li>
        <li>Provide information you requested about our services</li>
        <li>Add you to our early-access list (only if you explicitly opted in)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>4. How We Store Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are processed through a third-party form provider (Formspree or equivalent)
        and delivered to us by email. We do not store form data in any database on our end. Please
        review Formspree's privacy policy for their data handling practices.
      </p>

      <h2>5. California Residents — CCPA Rights</h2>
      <p>
        If you are a California resident, you have the following rights under the California Consumer
        Privacy Act (CCPA):
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Right to Know:</strong> You may request information about the personal data we have collected about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Delete:</strong> You may request that we delete personal information we hold about you.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Opt Out:</strong> We do not sell personal information. There is nothing to opt out of.</li>
        <li><strong>Right to Non-Discrimination:</strong> We will not discriminate against you for exercising your CCPA rights.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:pech@pechgroup.com">pech@pechgroup.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Our website does not use tracking cookies. If analytics are implemented, they use a
        cookie-free methodology. A cookie consent banner may appear if any cookie-based tools are
        added in the future.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party sites (such as WhatsApp or email clients).
        We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review
        their policies independently.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are not directed to individuals under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly
        collect personal information from minors.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. The "Last updated" date at the top of this
        page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of the website after changes
        constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy-related questions or requests, contact us at:<br />
        <a href="mailto:pech@pechgroup.com">pech@pechgroup.com</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
  }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--white); margin: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .page-header__sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .legal-notice {
    background: rgba(202,173,135,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(202,173,135,0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(1,8,45,0.07);
  }
  .legal-content h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; border-top: none; }
  .legal-content h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .legal-content p { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal-content ul li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--slate);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .legal-content a { color: var(--gold-dark); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
